From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:44:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] Verifier: a custody trace is never a PASS (V26 guard)

Before: a forged landed OpenLot in a recorded season, a Lot account or a
vault/caravan with custody fields verified as PASS (custody tags are
known tags; no check read them). V26:custody-guard runs on every season:
a landed custody instruction, a LOT_* record, a Lot's CLOSE, or a Lot /
custody counts / custody fields in any post-state or final account is a
FAIL (CustodyInProgramWithoutIt) in a season whose program has no
custody, and UNVERIFIABLE (CustodyUnverified) in a custody season until
V26 replays it. Refused transactions are not traces. tests/custody.rs.

Ported to the integration candidate c1e8137e: the module sits beside
the candidate's v26_growth, v27_residents and v28_resident_acts, and
uses workstream 18's Ctx::unverifiable (same signature) instead of adding
a second one. Note: the candidate registers workstream 8's map growth as
V26:map-growth, while workstream 4's allocation rev 6 gives V26 to
custody; the finding codes do not overlap, the check id does (left for
4).

